#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:1
msgid "HM-D13-4G 首次使用"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G Getting Started"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D13-4G** 从开箱状态运行到首次获得 **RTK 固定解**。开始前准备蜂窝网"
"络、Nano-SIM 卡和 CORS/NTRIP 账号。"
msgstr ""
"Run the **HM-D13-4G** from out-of-the-box state to the first time obtaining "
"an **RTK fixed solution**. Prepare a cellular network, Nano-SIM card, and "
"CORS/NTRIP account before starting."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:9
msgid "1. 核对设备与配件"
msgstr "Step 1: Check the equipment and accessories"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:10
msgid "产品标配："
msgstr "Standard Product Configuration:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:11
msgid "HM-D13-4G 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:12
msgid "5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口线缆。"
msgstr "5-pin GH1.25 mm interface cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:13
msgid "USB-C 配置线。"
msgstr "USB-C configuration cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:14
msgid "兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr "USB-to-UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:16
msgid "用户自备："
msgstr "User provides:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:17
msgid "5 V ±0.5 V 电源。"
msgstr "5 V ±0.5 V power supply."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:18
msgid "有流量的 Nano-SIM 卡。"
msgstr "Nano-SIM card with data."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:19
msgid ""
"CORS/NTRIP 账号和[对应配置工具](https://github.com/myrobotproject/"
"RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2_EN.rar)。"
msgstr ""
"CORS/NTRIP account and [corresponding configuration tool](https://github.com/"
"myrobotproject/RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/"
"JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2_EN.rar)."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:26
msgid "HM-D13-4G 主要组件与包装"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G major components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:26
msgid "HM-D13-4G 主要组件"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G major components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:30
msgid ""
"图片用于辅助识别产品和主要组件；实际交付内容以本页文字清单和随货装箱清单为"
"准。"
msgstr ""
"Images are provided to help identify the product and its major components. "
"The written list on this page and the packing list supplied with the product "
"define the actual contents."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:33
msgid "2. 确认输出协议"
msgstr "Step 2: Confirm output protocol"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:35
msgid ""
"D13 默认输出 10 Hz NMEA，可按需求配置为 UBX。接入前按目标设备确认交付输出协"
"议。"
msgstr ""
"D13 defaults to 10 Hz NMEA and can be configured for UBX on request. Confirm "
"the delivered output protocol before connecting the target device."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:37
msgid "3. 安装 SIM 卡并写入账号"
msgstr "Step 3: Install the SIM card and enter the account"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:39
msgid ""
"HM-D13-4G 的 Nano-SIM 卡槽和 USB-C 配置口位于顶壳内部。断电后打开顶壳，安装 "
"Nano-SIM 卡，再按[4G/CORS 配置](../differential-links/4g-ntrip.md)写入账号并"
"确认工具返回成功。"
msgstr ""
"The Nano-SIM card slot and USB-C configuration port of HM-D13-4G are located "
"inside the top cover. After powering off, open the top cover, install the "
"Nano-SIM card, then follow [4G / CORS Setup](../differential-links/4g-ntrip."
"md) to enter the account settings and verify a successful response."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:41
msgid "完成配置后断开 USB-C 线，恢复顶壳并确认装配可靠。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the configuration, disconnect the USB-C cable, replace the "
"top cover, and ensure the assembly is secure."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:43
msgid "4. 安装移动站"
msgstr "Step 4: Install rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:45
msgid ""
"将 D13 设备安装在天空视野开阔的位置，尽量避开金属遮挡、高楼、树木和强电磁干扰"
"源。"
msgstr ""
"Install the D13 receiver with a clear view of the sky. Keep it away from "
"metal obstructions, tall buildings, trees, and strong electromagnetic "
"interference where possible."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:47
msgid "5. 连接供电与 UART"
msgstr "Step 5: Connect power and UART"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:49
msgid ""
"保持设备断电并按[D13 接口与接线](../operation/d13-wiring.md)核对 Pin 1–5。设"
"备供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O 为 3.3 V；TX/RX 交叉连接并共地，确认信号和"
"极性后上电。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the device powered off and verify Pins 1–5 against [D13 Interfaces and "
"Wiring](../operation/d13-wiring.md). Supply 5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS I/O is 3.3 "
"V. Cross TX/RX, connect ground, and verify signals and polarity before power-"
"on."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:51
msgid "6. 查看定位输出"
msgstr "Step 6: Check positioning output"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"串口默认 115200 bps。按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`或使用目"
"标设备确认当前配置的协议持续输出，常规地面版为 10 Hz NMEA。"
msgstr ""
"The serial port defaults to 115200 bps. Follow {ref}`Connecting to "
"NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` or use the target device to verify "
"continuous output in the configured protocol. Standard ground firmware "
"outputs 10 Hz NMEA."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:55
msgid "7. 验证 RTK 固定解"
msgstr "Step 7: Verify RTK Fixed Solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:57
msgid ""
"按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)，通过与当前输"
"出协议兼容的工具或目标设备检查定位输出和解状态。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md) and use a tool or target device compatible with the current "
"output protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:59
msgid "首次使用完成判据"
msgstr "Getting Started success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:62
msgid "**定位数据持续输出，并进入 RTK 固定解。**"
msgstr ""
"**Positioning output remains continuous and reaches an RTK fixed solution.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:65
msgid ""
"若无法进入固定解，检查 Nano-SIM 卡、网络覆盖、CORS 账号、设备视野和供电，再进"
"入[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If you are unable to achieve a fixed solution, check the Nano-SIM card, "
"network coverage, CORS account, open-sky visibility, and power supply, then "
"proceed to [Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:67
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:69
msgid "[上位机连接与串口调试](../operation/host-tool.md)"
msgstr "[Host Connection and Serial Port Debugging](../operation/host-tool.md)"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:70
msgid "[平台接入](../integrations/index.rst)"
msgstr "[Platform Integration](../integrations/index.rst)"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-4g.md:71
msgid "[常用参数配置](../maintenance/parameters.md)"
msgstr "[Common Parameter Configuration](../maintenance/parameters.md)"

